    "reasoning": "Three independently labeled histories—overwhelming injury, a RIPK3/MLKL regulated example and prior apoptosis with inadequate clearance—converge on one late broken cell boundary. Necrosis remains broader than necroptosis; dye positivity or released generic material does not identify the pathway, immune learning or whole-tumor clearance.",
